msgstr "切换"

msgid "Only real chats are counted; test chat and benchmark are excluded. \"Confirmed\" means donations created by the assistant and marked paid."
msgstr "仅统计真实聊天;测试聊天和基准测试被排除在外。 “已确认”是指助理创建并标记为已付款的捐款。"

