msgstr "助理指示"

msgid "The main text describing how the assistant talks and the flow. Prices, donation types, bank details and what is known about the contact are added automatically on every reply. {brand} becomes the organisation name and {{belge:kisa-ad}} becomes that document's content."
msgstr "描述助理如何说话和流程的正文。每次回复时都会自动添加价格、捐赠类型、银行详细信息以及有关联系人的已知信息。{brand}成为组织名称,{{belge:kisa-ad}} 成为该文档的内容。"

