msgstr "%s:连接详细信息"

msgid "Using Flux Mail connection: %s."
msgstr "使用 Flux 邮件连接:%s。"

msgid "Still using the old provider in Flux Certificates; move the connection to Flux Mail and select it here."
msgstr "仍在 Flux 证书中使用旧的提供程序;将连接移至 Flux Mail 并在此处选择它。"

msgid "Using the Evolution provider from Flux Certificates."
msgstr "使用 Flux 证书中的 Evolution 提供程序。"

msgid "API URL, key and instance are entered in this plugin."
msgstr "API URL、密钥和实例在此插件中输入。"

msgid "%s: line status"
msgstr "%s:线路状态"

msgid "Phone connected (last seen %s)."
msgstr "电话已连接(上次查看%s)。"

msgid "Not tested yet. Press \"Test connection\"."
msgstr "尚未测试。按“测试连接”。"

msgid "Phone not connected (state: %1$s, %2$s). Reconnect with \"Connect with QR\"."
msgstr "电话未连接(状态:%1$s、%2$s)。通过“使用 QR 连接”重新连接。"

msgid "%s: Evolution API version"
msgstr "%s:进化 API 版本"

msgid "Evolution API %s is in use. Replies to hidden-number (@lid) contacts may fail; update the server to 2.3 or later."
msgstr "Evolution API%s正在使用中。回复隐藏号码 (@lid) 联系人可能会失败;将服务器更新到2.3或更高版本。"

msgid "%s: webhook (incoming messages)"
msgstr "%s:网络钩子(传入消息)"

msgid "No events have arrived from Evolution; incoming messages will not show in the panel. Press \"Set up webhook\"."
msgstr "进化还没有发生任何事件;传入的消息不会显示在面板中。按“设置网络钩子”。"

msgid "Last event arrived %s. The line may just be quiet; send yourself a message or set up the webhook again to be sure."
msgstr "最后一个事件到达%s。线路可能只是安静;向自己发送消息或再次设置 Webhook 以确定。"

msgid "Last event arrived %s."
msgstr "最后一个事件到达%s。"

msgid "Flux Mail integration"
msgstr "Flux 邮件集成"

msgid "Active: WhatsApp connections are taken from Communication › Connections."
msgstr "活动:WhatsApp 连接取自通信 › 连接。"

msgid "Flux Mail is not active; connections are taken from Flux Certificates or from this plugin."
msgstr "Flux 邮件未激活;连接取自 Flux 证书或此插件。"

msgid "Flux Certificates integration"
msgstr "Flux证书集成"

msgid "Active: certificates can be created and sent from chats."
msgstr "活动:可以通过聊天创建和发送证书。"

msgid "Flux Certificates is not active; certificate actions in chats are off."
msgstr "Flux 证书未激活;聊天中的证书操作已关闭。"

msgid "Flux Donate integration"
msgstr "通量捐赠整合"

msgid "Active: donation records, receipt matching and the assistant are available from chats."
msgstr "活跃:可以通过聊天查看捐赠记录、收据匹配和助手。"

msgid "Flux Donate is not active; donation records, receipt matching and the donation assistant are off."
msgstr "通量捐赠未激活;捐赠记录、收据匹配和捐赠助理均已关闭。"

msgid "The Flux AI & MCP plugin is not installed; AI features (suggestions, assistant, receipt reading, voice messages, summaries) are off. Install Flux AI and enter the key there."
msgstr "Flux AI & MCP插件未安装;人工智能功能(建议、助手、收据阅读、语音消息、摘要)已关闭。安装 Flux AI 并在那里输入密钥。"

msgid "No key has been entered in Flux AI; message suggestions and the assistant are off."
msgstr "Flux AI 中尚未输入密钥;消息建议和助手已关闭。"

msgid "Key saved but no model selected."
msgstr "密钥已保存,但未选择型号。"

msgid "No provider key has been entered in Flux AI for the selected model (%s)."
msgstr "尚未在 Flux AI 中输入所选模型 (%s) 的提供商密钥。"

msgid "Key saved, model: %s. Use \"Test connection\" for a live check."
msgstr "密钥已保存,型号:%s。使用“测试连接”进行实时检查。"

msgid "Donation assistant"
msgstr "捐赠助理"

msgid "Off."
msgstr "关闭。"

msgid "AI key or model is missing."
msgstr "AI 密钥或模型丢失。"

msgid "On but not replying: "
msgstr "已开启但未回复:"

msgid "On. Donation types offered: %s."
msgstr "上。提供的捐赠类型:%s。"

msgid "%s does not support tools; choose a tool-capable model for the assistant."
msgstr "%s不支持工具;为助手选择一个支持工具的模型。"

msgid "Receipt reading model"
msgstr "收据读取模型"

msgid "%s cannot read images; the receipt pre-check will not work. Choose an image-capable receipt reading model."
msgstr "%s无法读取图像;收据预检查将不起作用。选择具有图像功能的收据读取型号。"

msgid "Assistant payment details"
msgstr "助理付款详情"

msgid "Recipient name and IBAN set."
msgstr "收件人姓名和 IBAN 设置。"

msgid "Recipient name or IBAN missing; bank details cannot be sent after confirmation."
msgstr "收件人姓名或 IBAN 缺失;确认后无法发送银行详细信息。"

msgid "Donation page link"
msgstr "捐赠页面链接"

msgid "Donation page not found; the assistant will not send a link."
msgstr "找不到捐赠页面;助手不会发送链接。"

msgid "Background requests"
msgstr "后台请求"

msgid "The site could not send a background request to itself (%1$s: %2$s). Queued replies and the benchmark may move slowly; a security plugin or the server firewall may be blocking /wp-json/flx-chat/ requests."
msgstr "该站点无法向自身发送后台请求(%1$s:%2$s)。排队回复和基准可能会缓慢移动;安全插件或服务器防火墙可能会阻止 /wp-json/flx-chat/ 请求。"

msgid "error"
msgstr "错误"

msgid "warning"
msgstr "警告"

msgid "ok"
msgstr "好的"

msgid "Your {marka} verification code: {kod}"
msgstr "您的{marka}验证码:{kod}"

msgid "The code is valid for {dk} minutes. Type it in your WhatsApp chat with us. If you did not ask for it, ignore this message."
msgstr "该代码的有效期为{dk}分钟。在您与我们的 WhatsApp 聊天中输入该信息。如果您没有要求,请忽略此消息。"

msgid "Something went wrong; our team will contact you as soon as possible 🌱 Meanwhile, feel free to ask anything else."
msgstr "出了点问题;我们的团队会尽快与您联系🌱 同时,如有其他问题,请随时询问。"

msgid "Verification attempt failed (%1$d/%2$d): %3$s"
msgstr "验证尝试失败(%1$d/%2$d):%3$s"

msgid "The person wanted to see their records but could not be verified; someone from the team should get in touch"
msgstr "该人想查看自己的记录,但无法核实; someone from the team should get in touch"

msgid "e-mail could not be sent (check Flux Mail › SMTP settings)"
msgstr "无法发送电子邮件(检查 Flux Mail › SMTP 设置)"

msgid "The assistant sent a verification code for %1$s (%2$s)."
msgstr "助手发送了%1$s(%2$s) 的验证码。"

msgid "code expired"
msgstr "代码已过期"

msgid "wrong code"
msgstr "错误代码"

msgid "The person verified the code for %s; it is added to their record lookups."
msgstr "该人验证了%s的代码; it is added to their record lookups."

msgid "Claude models cannot read audio; choose an audio-capable OpenRouter model in Settings › AI › Voice message model."
msgstr "克劳德模型无法读取音频;在设置 › AI › 语音消息模型中选择支持音频的 OpenRouter 模型。"

msgid "The audio could not be transcribed."
msgstr "音频无法转录。"

msgid "The audio file could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取音频文件。"

msgid "Voice message (%1$s) transcribed: %2$s"
msgstr "语音消息 (%1$s) 转录:%2$s"

msgid "Voice message (%1$s) could not be processed: %2$s"
msgstr "无法处理语音消息 (%1$s):%2$s"

msgid "This action is not available on an official WhatsApp Cloud API line."
msgstr "此操作在官方 WhatsApp Cloud API 线路上不可用。"

msgid "WhatsApp 24-hour rule: the contact has not written in the last 24 hours, so the Cloud API will not send a free-form message; only an approved template can be sent. Try again once they write."
msgstr "WhatsApp 24 小时规则:联系人在过去 24 小时内没有写信,因此 Cloud API 不会发送自由格式消息;只能发送经过批准的模板。他们写完后再试一次。"

msgid "A Cloud API line needs Flux Mail 1.10.0 or later."
msgstr "Cloud API 行需要 Flux Mail 1.10.0 或更高版本。"

msgid "The Cloud API cannot send to this address (hidden number or group)."
msgstr "Cloud API 无法发送到此地址(隐藏号码或群组)。"

msgid "Could not reach the Cloud API account (İletişim › Connections)."
msgstr "无法访问云 API 帐户(?letişim › 连接)。"

msgid "A Cloud API line has no QR code; the account is set up in İletişim › Connections."
msgstr "Cloud API 线路没有二维码;该帐户是在 îletişim › Connections 中设置的。"

msgid "The file could not be prepared."
msgstr "无法准备该文件。"

msgid "Flux AI has no image support."
msgstr "Flux AI 没有图像支持。"

msgid "The image could not be rendered."
msgstr "无法渲染图像。"

msgid "The assistant's image could not be sent: "
msgstr "助理图片无法发送:"

msgid "Hello {first_name}, we have created your donation record: {donation}, total {amount}.\n\n{bank}\n\nAfter paying, you can send the receipt here. Thank you."
msgstr "您好{first_name},我们已创建您的捐款记录:{donation},总计{amount}。{bank}付款后,您可以将收据发送至此处。谢谢。"

msgid "Hello {first_name}, your donation has been recorded: {donation}, total {amount}.\n\nThank you for your support."
msgstr "您好{first_name},您的捐款已记录:{donation},总计{amount}。\n\n感谢您的支持。"

msgid "The plugin that would run this scenario is inactive."
msgstr "运行此场景的插件处于非活动状态。"

msgid "This user is not allowed to use the staff tools."
msgstr "该用户无权使用员工工具。"

msgid "%1$s linked this chat to staff member %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s将此聊天链接到工作人员%2$s"

msgid "%s removed the staff link of this chat"
msgstr "%s删除了此聊天的员工链接"

msgid "Chat linked to staff member"
msgstr "与工作人员关联的聊天"

msgid "Staff link removed"
msgstr "员工链接已删除"

msgid "— Not staff —"
msgstr "— 不是工作人员 —"

msgid "WhatsApp hides this person's number, so the assistant cannot recognise staff by number. If this person is on your team, link them here and the assistant opens the staff tools."
msgstr "WhatsApp 隐藏了此人的号码,因此助理无法通过号码识别工作人员。如果此人在您的团队中,请在此处链接他们,助理将打开员工工具。"

msgid "The assistant recognises staff by the number in their Flux Roles profile. If the number does not match, you can link them here; in a chat with a known number the number comes first."
msgstr "助理通过员工 Flux 角色档案中的号码来识别员工。如果号码不匹配,您可以在此处链接;在与已知号码聊天时,号码排在第一位。"

msgid "This channel is not available right now."
msgstr "该频道目前不可用。"

msgid "Site chat"
msgstr "现场聊天"

msgid "All messages from WhatsApp, site chat and other channels appear here live. Pick a chat on the left."
msgstr "来自 WhatsApp、网站聊天和其他渠道的所有消息都会实时显示在这里。选择左侧的聊天。"

msgid "WhatsApp (Evolution API) call center: see live incoming and outgoing messages, start new chat, canned replies, tags, assignment, internal notes, auto-replies; Donation (Flux Donate) and certificate (Flux Certificates) registration from chat, receipt matching. Artificial intelligence response suggestion and automatic donation assistant with OpenRouter."
msgstr "WhatsApp(Evolution API)呼叫中心:查看实时传入和传出消息、开始新聊天、预设回复、标签、作业、内部注释、自动回复;通过聊天注册捐赠(Flux Donate)和证书(Flux Certificates),收据匹配。 OpenRouter 的人工智能响应建议和自动捐赠助手。"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "隐藏"

msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

msgid "Deleted for everyone"
msgstr "已对所有人删除"

msgid "Hidden in the panel"
msgstr "已在面板中隐藏"

msgid "Delete for everyone"
msgstr "对所有人删除"

msgid "Hide in the panel only"
msgstr "仅在面板中隐藏"

msgid "WhatsApp doesn't allow deleting a received message for everyone; it stays on the contact's phone and is only hidden in the panel."
msgstr "WhatsApp 不允许对所有人删除收到的消息；消息仍保留在联系人手机上，仅在面板中隐藏。"

msgid "Delete for everyone is turned off in the settings; the message is only hidden in the panel and stays on the contact's phone."
msgstr "设置中已关闭“对所有人删除”；消息仅在面板中隐藏，仍保留在联系人手机上。"

msgid "This channel doesn't support delete for everyone; the message is only hidden in the panel and stays on the contact's phone."
msgstr "此渠道不支持“对所有人删除”；消息仅在面板中隐藏，仍保留在联系人手机上。"

msgid "The time limit for delete for everyone has passed (WhatsApp allows about {h} hours after sending). The message stays on the contact's phone and is only hidden in the panel."
msgstr "已超过“对所有人删除”的时限（WhatsApp 允许在发送后约 {h} 小时内删除）。消息仍保留在联系人手机上，仅在面板中隐藏。"

msgid "Only the sender or an administrator can delete this message for everyone; you can hide it in the panel."
msgstr "只有发送者或管理员可以对所有人删除此消息；您可以在面板中隐藏它。"

msgid "If deleted for everyone, the message also turns into \"This message was deleted\" on the contact's phone. Time left: about {n} hours."
msgstr "若对所有人删除，联系人手机上的消息也会变为“此消息已删除”。剩余时间：约 {n} 小时。"

msgid "Deleted messages are kept on the server: the chat shows a \"This message was deleted\" line and the team can click it to see the content. AI does not read deleted messages."
msgstr "已删除的消息保留在服务器上：聊天中显示“此消息已删除”，团队点击即可查看内容。AI 不会读取已删除的消息。"

msgid "Message not found."
msgstr "未找到消息。"

msgid "This message was already deleted."
msgstr "此消息已被删除。"

msgid "Only the sender or an administrator can delete this message for everyone."
msgstr "只有发送者或管理员可以对所有人删除此消息。"

msgid "This message can't be deleted for everyone on this channel. You can hide it in the panel instead."
msgstr "此渠道无法对所有人删除此消息。您可以改为在面板中隐藏。"

msgid "The time limit for deleting for everyone has passed. You can hide it in the panel instead."
msgstr "已超过“对所有人删除”的时限。您可以改为在面板中隐藏。"

msgid "WhatsApp did not delete the message."
msgstr "WhatsApp 未删除该消息。"

msgid "Delete for everyone time limit (hours)"
msgstr "“对所有人删除”时限（小时）"

msgid "WhatsApp lets you delete a sent message for everyone only for about 2 days and 12 hours (60 hours). After this limit, or for received messages, the message is only hidden in the panel: it stays on the contact's phone. 0 turns off delete for everyone. Deleted messages are never removed from the server; the team can still open them."
msgstr "WhatsApp 仅允许在约 2 天 12 小时（60 小时）内对所有人删除已发送的消息。超过时限或对于收到的消息，消息仅在面板中隐藏，仍保留在联系人手机上。设为 0 将关闭“对所有人删除”。已删除的消息永远不会从服务器移除，团队仍可打开查看。"
